      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8AB0768450914F5CFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是被圓絲蛛牠們給捆起來的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
